From: Bogdan Mircea <mirceapetrebogdan@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] SME: refresh FT target association and security metadata

FT over DS bypasses the normal authentication setup and can retain association
metadata and AP security IEs from the old BSS. Reuse native metadata builders
for the selected target, pass its RSNXE to the existing FT owner, and refresh
target security IEs before reassociation validation. Keep the original FT
cryptographic checks, strict RSNE comparison and key-installation lifetime.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: Bogdan Mircea <mirceapetrebogdan@gmail.com>
---

